",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}],{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"docs-layout server-guide\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"aside\",null,{\"className\":\"sidebar\",\"aria-label\":\"Reference workflow guide\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"href\":\"/docs\",\"children\":\"Documentation\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"href\":\"/examples\",\"children\":\"Five reference apps\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#run\",\"children\":\"Run locally\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#review\",\"children\":\"Review and confirm\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#boundaries\",\"children\":\"Access and data boundaries\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"prose\",\"style\":{\"minWidth\":0},\"aria-label\":\"Persistent reference workflow guide\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"eyebrow\",\"children\":\"Working examples\"}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"children\":\"Review a real change. Keep its audit.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Five reference applications connect React review surfaces to actual MCP tools and a persistent private SQLite workspace. Inspect supplied evidence,correct fields,review an order,change a reference preference or save a research decision.\"}],\"$L5\",\"$L6\",\"$L7\",\"$L8\",\"$L9\",\"$La\",\"$Lb\",\"$Lc\",\"$Ld\",\"$Le\",\"$Lf\",\"$L10\"]}]]}],null,\"$L11\"]}],{},null,false,null]},null,false,\"$12\"]},null,false,\"$12\"]},null,false,null],\"$L13\",false]],\"m\":\"$undefined\",\"G\":[\"$14\",[\"$L15\"]],\"S\":true,\"h\":null,\"r\":\"$undefined\",\"s\":\"$undefined\",\"a\":\"$undefined\",\"l\":\"$undefined\",\"p\":\"$undefined\",\"d\":\"$undefined\"}\n16:I[69